(Which problem am I trying to solve?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 331.6537795275589815 Td
("Local shoppers and small-scale grocery vendors struggle with overly complex e-commerce) Tj
T* (platforms that require account creation, have slow loading times, and lack a direct communication) Tj
T* (channel for order confirmation.") Tj
T* (The goal is to bridge the gap between a simple shopping list and a full-scale enterprise engine by) Tj
T* (providing a lightweight, "no-database" solution that feels professional but acts instantaneously.) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 209.7640157480313974 Td
(Who is affected by this problem?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 178.5829133858267141 Td
() Tj
T* (The "Hurry-Up" Shopper: Users who want to restock 5-10 essential items in under 60 seconds) Tj
T* (without remembering a password.) Tj
T* (The Small Vendor: A local grocer who needs an online presence but doesn't have the budget or) Tj
T* (technical skill to manage a complex SQL database or backend server.) Tj
T* (The Mobile User: People shopping on-the-go who need a high-performance, "App-like" experience) Tj
T* (on a mobile browser.) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
