("How might we create a frictionless grocery ordering experience that captures delivery details and) Tj
T* (product selections into a single email notification, eliminating the need for a backend while) Tj
T* (maintaining data persistence for the user?") Tj
T* () Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 588.1892125984251152 Td
(Why is this problem important to solve?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 557.0081102362204319 Td
() Tj
T* (Reduced Friction: By using Web3Forms, the order goes straight to the vendor's inbox—no logging) Tj
T* (into a dashboard required.) Tj
T* (Reliability: LocalStorage ensures that if a user accidentally closes their tab, their milk and bread are) Tj
T* (still in the cart when they return.) Tj
T* (Development Speed: Using a "Backend-less" stack \(React + Tailwind + Web3Forms\) allows a) Tj
T* (developer to go from concept to a live store in hours, not weeks.) Tj
T* () Tj
ET
BT
