56.6929133858267775 372.7561417322834245 Td
() Tj
T* (Insight A: The "Search" bar is the most used feature in grocery apps; it must be prominent.) Tj
T* (Insight B: Users want to see the Grand Total update in real-time as they toggle quantities.) Tj
T* (Insight C: "Delivery Time Preference" is a deal-breaker. If they can't choose a time, they won't) Tj
T* (submit the form.) Tj
T* () Tj
