(SmartCart is a lightweight grocery ordering website built using React and Tailwind CSS. It allows) Tj
T* (customers to browse products, add items to a cart, and submit delivery details. Orders are sent) Tj
T* (directly to the store via Web3Forms without requiring a backend. This makes it affordable and easy) Tj
T* (for small businesses to go digital quickly.) Tj
